Laskude vahel.

00:27:15.000 --> 00:27:17.000
Kus see püstol praegu on?

00:27:17.000 --> 00:27:19.000
Käskisin väikevennal
sellest vabaneda.

00:27:20.000 --> 00:27:22.000
Kus see siis on?

00:27:23.000 --> 00:27:25.000
Ma ei tea.

00:27:26.000 --> 00:27:28.000
Aaron, sa valetad!

